Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.01,0:00:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.83,0:00:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.95,0:01:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears to be a tranquil\Nmorning in light of last night's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.61,0:01:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,chaos When unexplained illuminations\Nin the night sky And unusual
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.95,0:01:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,weather patterns were reported\Nin dozens of countries around the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.35,0:01:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,globe Are these events related to the\Nrecent monster sightings? More to come,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.29,0:01:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,but first,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.20,0:01:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,the lottery numbers I guess whatever\Nhappened here last night happened everywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.99,0:01:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.90,0:01:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But thanks to this card, Yugi was able\Nto kick that thing's supernatural butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.93,0:01:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Till it comes back again, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.99,0:01:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I still don't know how a Duel\NMonsters card did all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.31,0:01:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't seem like\Nanything too special to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.99,0:01:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, to the untrained eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.47,0:01:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But any real duelist can tell\Nthat this card's special.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.19,0:01:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be handled with care.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.49,0:01:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.57,0:01:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.48,0:01:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no telling what\Nelse this thing can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.89,0:01:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.17,0:01:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The Eye of Timaeus contains the\Nspirit of an ancient dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.69,0:02:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And although it protected\Nus, it could be dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.37,0:02:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think we should do something?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.27,0:02:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Like what, Paya?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.41,0:02:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't even know where\Nto begin to figure this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.37,0:02:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we could start with\Nthe monster sightings,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.79,0:02:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,or that giant eye that tried to blast us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.49,0:02:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Then there's that motorcycle gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.67,0:02:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, the one that\Nsteals people's souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.55,0:02:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe the secret lies in your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.17,0:02:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey you, let me have a look at that card
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.57,0:02:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe if we can get that dragon\Nto come out He can give us a clue
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.23,0:02:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,what's going on around here I thought\Nit had to be handled with care,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.47,0:02:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.38,0:02:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Expert Hey, that's it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.29,0:02:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,pal You're going down for the count\Nnow Can't you smell what I'm cooking?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.13,0:02:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,All I smell are your socks Excuse me,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.71,0:02:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mean to interrupt, kids\NAre we being too loud, Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.37,0:02:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I just wanted to give\Nyou this It came in the mail
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.37,0:02:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's it from?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.79,0:02:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure. Oh, my eyesight's\Nnot what it used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.51,0:02:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hope it's good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.93,0:02:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We could use some.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.93,0:02:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.84,0:02:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No, what's the matter, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.93,0:02:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.09,0:03:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,From the office of Maximilian Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.37,0:03:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.28,0:03:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Not Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.47,0:03:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just like the Duelist\NKingdom all over again, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.81,0:03:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I say we toss that thing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.83,0:03:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we gotta open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.49,0:03:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm with Tristan on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.57,0:03:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This is exactly how Pegasus\Nstole Grandpa's soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.51,0:03:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done to them, Pegasus,\Nand where have you taken us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.19,0:03:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We're no longer in the world you know,\Nbut I'll return you, all in good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.65,0:03:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.15,0:03:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I, too, possess a Millennium Item.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.93,0:03:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.53,0:03:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, it can.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.23,0:03:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I'll show you the\Ntrue extent of its magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.37,0:03:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, I found that\Ngiven the proper incentive,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.61,0:03:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,anyone can be made to play my game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.55,0:04:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just tape over it with\Nsome Saturday morning cartoons.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.17,0:04:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you so worried about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.63,0:04:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like he has the\NMillennium Eye anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.59,0:04:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.75,0:04:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.66,0:04:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Last time we saw him, he\Nwas a little less creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.07,0:04:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I still think it's bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.45,0:04:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So what should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.91,0:04:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We should hear what he has to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.95,0:04:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, Pegasus did\Ninvent Duel Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.89,0:04:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And you think maybe he has something\Nto do with what's been going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.83,0:04:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.74,0:04:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's play the tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.51,0:04:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.67,0:04:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Just trust me, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.49,0:04:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't we vote on this or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.47,0:04:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.37,0:04:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone grab hold of something solid!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.27,0:04:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings, Yugi boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.51,0:04:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been so long. You never\Ncall, you never write after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.49,0:04:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,we've been through together You\Ncould at least send an email.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.31,0:04:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey guys, we're all still\Nin the room, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.13,0:04:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now unless you've been living\Nunder a rock for the past two days
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.55,0:04:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're aware that dual\Nmonsters are suddenly running
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.91,0:05:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,amok all around this world of\Nours Luckily for me Kaiba boy's
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.23,0:05:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,been taking most of the heat\Nfor this recent state of affairs
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.63,0:05:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, I know who's\Nreally behind this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.65,0:05:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you we should play this tape, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.93,0:05:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I must stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.29,0:05:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They're ruining the reputation of my game,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.45,0:05:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm afraid that's just\Nnot good for business.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.05,0:05:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The only catch is it's too risky to\Nleave you any information on this tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.15,0:05:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So that means you'll have\Nto come see me in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.79,0:05:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.73,0:05:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only way to\Nensure complete secrecy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.83,0:05:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And last but not least, I've\Nenclosed a one-of-a-kind card.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.17,0:05:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Just make sure you don't lose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.97,0:05:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.29,0:05:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only way to enter my compound.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.03,0:05:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Guard it with your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.79,0:05:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,They mustn't take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.33,0:05:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way we can\Ntrust that guy. Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.73,0:05:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.01,0:05:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus may just be our only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.89,0:05:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.37,0:05:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, guys, I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.61,0:06:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.37,0:06:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll be right\Nthere by your side, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.17,0:06:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.01,0:06:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean that, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.67,0:06:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, consider my bags already packed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.35,0:06:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, count me in. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.13,0:06:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He is flying us there first class, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.53,0:06:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.44,0:06:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What are friends for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.35,0:06:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They're for helping each other fight bad\Nguys who want to take over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.77,0:06:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.68,0:06:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess that's one way to put it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.49,0:06:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why are we standing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.13,0:06:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go see Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.73,0:06:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that, Rex?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.97,0:06:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but what I don't get is\Nwhy Pegasus needs those losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.81,0:06:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He should have given that tape to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.97,0:06:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, just because we weren't invited to\Nthe party doesn't mean we can't show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.21,0:06:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see where all the cards get made.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.09,0:06:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,All the cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.61,0:06:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, every rare card under the\Nrainbow, and they're all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.99,0:06:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Who said I'm not a nice guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.05,0:06:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a dream come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.67,0:06:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus, you're the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.25,0:07:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be sick. All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.33,0:07:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,let's go All those rare cards should\Nbelong to me And me Before long,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.53,0:07:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,our dueling decks will\Nbe unstoppable That's
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.23,0:07:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,right We just have to get\Nto Pegasus before them
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.45,0:07:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, how do we do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.67,0:07:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd never ask
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.53,0:07:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Our time will come, great Leviathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.75,0:07:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,By the might of the three\NEgyptian gods, you've been reborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.19,0:07:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And once I replenish\Nyou with enough souls,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.27,0:07:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,you shall inherit the\Nstrength to swallow the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.35,0:07:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No one will stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.03,0:07:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.59,0:07:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I summon Tobias!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.89,0:08:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, the pharaoh holds\Nthe power of the dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.89,0:08:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But that is merely a minor\Nsetback to be dealt with later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.67,0:08:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Raphael!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.58,0:08:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Master Darts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.97,0:08:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.67,0:08:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll find the pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.37,0:08:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,At this time, I'll make sure we drain\Nhis power to feed the great beast, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.65,0:08:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you try listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.71,0:08:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really a wonderful skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.97,0:08:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And when you master it, you'll realize that\Nwe need more than just a pharaoh's soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.31,0:08:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll deal with the others, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.49,0:08:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.53,0:08:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I got me eye on someone, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.87,0:08:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That feisty little bloke Joey Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.83,0:08:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He should be fun to take apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.29,0:08:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I know why you're after Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.43,0:08:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind your own business, Alistair.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.55,0:08:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.07,0:08:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the sudden interest in Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.19,0:08:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I have my reasons,\NFallon. Really? Knock it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.25,0:08:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in the presence of Master Darts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.05,0:09:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The Pharaoh and his\Nfriends are on their way
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.51,0:09:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,to speak with the one we've been watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.55,0:09:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Just make certain that you'll\Nreach him before they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.11,0:09:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.02,0:09:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And to think, I called you a bad listener.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.73,0:09:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go see Pegasus at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.91,0:09:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe the very\Nmonsters I made famous
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.99,0:09:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Are now terrorizing\Npeople around the world
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.19,0:09:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about bad publicity Do you\Nalways talk to yourself like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.65,0:09:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta get yourself some friends, honey
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.77,0:09:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But how did you get past my security?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.83,0:09:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.85,0:09:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.87,0:09:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got one pair of platform clogs,\Nfour t-shirts, and two pairs of shorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.87,0:09:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to go shopping one of these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.27,0:09:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing fits!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.67,0:09:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.21,0:10:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll leave my yo-yo home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.63,0:10:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We fly out tomorrow, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.51,0:10:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Somewhere in California.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.45,0:10:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I made sure to\Npack plenty of sunscreen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.03,0:10:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that ought to do it. All packed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.81,0:10:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The card Pegasus sent me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.93,0:10:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's one thing I\Ndon't want to forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.41,0:10:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He said this card is one of a kind,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.79,0:10:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and it sounded like someone\Nwants to get their hands on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.17,0:10:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever seen this card before?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.93,0:10:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.84,0:10:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Something on your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.57,0:10:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.75,0:10:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, spill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.91,0:10:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.82,0:10:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm perfectly fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.13,0:10:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, I know you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.15,0:10:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're worried about something\Nand you don't want to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.09,0:10:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.59,0:10:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.50,0:10:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hide anything from you, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.01,0:10:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Then tell me what's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.71,0:10:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just that we know\Nso little about what
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.15,0:11:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,we're up against and\Nwho this new enemy is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.47,0:11:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,If I only understood\Nmore about my own past,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.61,0:11:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I could be more helpful in\Nanswering these questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.55,0:11:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.17,0:11:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.08,0:11:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, I know your thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.43,0:11:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits are bonded together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.67,0:11:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, that's probably why\Nyou're worried about all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.93,0:11:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I am too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.03,0:11:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This seems like our toughest fight yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.49,0:11:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And the future of the entire\Nworld is depending on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.07,0:11:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What if we mess things up? We won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.93,0:11:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.87,0:11:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I sound silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.05,0:11:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.45,0:11:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a huge day ahead of us, and\Nour new adventure starts tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.31,0:11:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,the white zone is for\Nimmediate loading and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.97,0:11:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,unloading there is no\Nparking in the white zone
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.83,0:11:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,see you soon grandpa take\Ncare and don't forget
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.87,0:11:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,to keep your seats upright\Nduring takeoff and don't
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.29,0:12:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,fill up on peanuts sure\Nbye grandpa well we're off
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.47,0:12:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the ride. You\Nkids be careful. You'll know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.77,0:12:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, there it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.41,0:12:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, this is awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.39,0:12:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,A private jet. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.75,0:12:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I plan to have a whole fleet\Nof these things someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.87,0:12:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And Joey has a nice ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.87,0:12:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So why do you think Pegasus decided\Nto fly you out to meet with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.71,0:12:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.62,0:12:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.53,0:12:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,but he may need someone to help him duel\Nagainst whoever's causing this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.43,0:12:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And good thing I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.03,0:12:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Is one of you kids Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.87,0:12:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, sir, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.79,0:12:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you and your friends will follow\Nus, we can get this show on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.63,0:12:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You two make yourselves useful and\Ncarry their luggage to the plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.25,0:12:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.17,0:12:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.49,0:12:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this place!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.97,0:12:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like a total rock star!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.77,0:13:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet they serve some fancy food, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.97,0:13:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.88,0:13:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm talking extra leg room, folks!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.55,0:13:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you have a seat, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.39,0:13:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.49,0:13:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, give me a hand\Nwith this one, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.03,0:13:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You wimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.49,0:13:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.29,0:13:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch it! Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.15,0:13:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.09,0:13:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Pegasus One, requesting\Npermission for takeoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.63,0:13:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Permission granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.81,0:13:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You are clear for takeoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.21,0:13:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.93,0:13:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.27,0:13:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see how fast this baby can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.43,0:13:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's going according to plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.23,0:13:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't think of everything, Bug Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.71,0:13:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to go to the bathroom really badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.67,0:13:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Then hold it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.73,0:14:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to go before\Nwe left, dino-brain!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.59,0:14:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Your lunch is served.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.43,0:14:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take two. No, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.47,0:14:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it so freezing in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.73,0:14:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I let this guy talk me\Ninto stopping myself into a smelly gym bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.49,0:14:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The last thing I needed was ice\Nparticles forming in my underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.59,0:14:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but no amount of\Nrare cards is worth all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.83,0:14:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this is it, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.13,0:14:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus, here we come.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.71,0:14:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the easy part's over, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.35,0:14:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Step inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.43,0:14:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have a minute to spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.59,0:14:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.09,0:14:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The glitz and glamour continues!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.49,0:15:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I never saw that bag before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.15,0:15:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Did any of you guys pack this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.21,0:15:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope, it's not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.71,0:15:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine's the white one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.77,0:15:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Never saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.81,0:15:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We probably grabbed someone\Nelse's bag by mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.49,0:15:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.57,0:15:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll just toss it\Nin the lost and found.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.23,0:15:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we were so close, Weevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.31,0:15:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't feel so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.33,0:15:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be long now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.63,0:15:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I said hold all my calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.21,0:15:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And tell those reporters out\Nthere once and for all that Kaiba
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.49,0:15:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Corp is not responsible in any\Nway for these monster sightings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.19,0:15:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,End of story.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.45,0:15:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't come back till they're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.41,0:15:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.31,0:15:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I think someone's trying\Nto make a fool out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.65,0:15:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I have worked too hard repairing\Nthe reputation of this company.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.69,0:15:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This has to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.81,0:15:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Roland, I need an update\Non our investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.63,0:15:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we have any leads whatsoever?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.49,0:15:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing yet, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.75,0:15:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I want answers, and I want them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.85,0:15:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.35,0:16:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The timing of this mess couldn't be worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.99,0:16:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to announce my latest project.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.19,0:16:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, check out our database.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.49,0:16:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There's someone out there that's\Nbuying up every share of our company.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.17,0:16:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.57,0:16:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.59,0:16:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.83,0:16:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, you're right. Told ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.25,0:16:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If these numbers are accurate,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.21,0:16:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,almost half of Kaiba Corp was\Njust bought by one person.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.49,0:16:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And they're still buying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.95,0:16:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But how can that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.71,0:16:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.65,0:16:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.59,0:16:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If they buy any more shares, they could\Ntake control of the entire company.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.09,0:16:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's no way I'm gonna allow that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.49,0:16:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, there's only one person who's\Ncapable of something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.77,0:16:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.91,0:16:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba Boy, I've missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.97,0:16:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.09,0:16:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I'm guilty as charged.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.09,0:16:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like we're partners now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.11,0:16:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This is going to be so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.25,0:16:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This company's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.87,0:17:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You're always so uptight, Kybervore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.25,0:17:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you treat yourself\Nto a nice vacation? Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.09,0:17:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never let a snake like you\Nwrap yourself around my company.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.97,0:17:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.27,0:17:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.18,0:17:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want your company.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.73,0:17:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I just needed the upper hand so I\Ncould force you to do something for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.65,0:17:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, I was bored and it was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.15,0:17:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, since both of our reputations are\Nat stake, thanks to these pesky monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.97,0:17:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we could boost our\Npublic image by doing each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.19,0:17:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be out of your mind, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.77,0:17:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I take that as a no?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.87,0:17:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'd reconsider if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.35,0:17:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if not,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.81,0:17:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll buy the rest of Kyber Corp and\Ntake it apart piece by pathetic piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.63,0:17:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.05,0:17:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we have ourselves a rematch?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.73,0:17:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Or should I just proceed with plan B?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.95,0:17:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.86,0:17:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I need an answer, Kaiba Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.21,0:17:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.09,0:17:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You have yourself a duel, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.61,0:17:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd see things my way,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.61,0:18:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So I've set up an arena\Nfor us in Duelist Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.41,0:18:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,for old time's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.97,0:18:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget to bring your\Nblue-eyes white dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.43,0:18:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.03,0:18:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We were supposed to start building Kaivaland\Namusement parks all over the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.39,0:18:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and Seto promised he wouldn't\Nduel until we were done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.91,0:18:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He even locked all his cards\Naway, so he wouldn't be tempted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.81,0:18:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you want\Nto go through with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.57,0:18:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no choice, Mukuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.49,0:18:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Access granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.69,0:18:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Disengaging security system.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.87,0:18:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe Pegasus was just bluffing, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.93,0:18:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take that chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.03,0:18:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.25,0:19:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew someday I would unlock\Nmy deck and duel again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.05,0:19:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I just never thought\Nit would be this soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.11,0:19:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.87,0:19:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.03,0:19:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.11,0:19:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we were going to\Nget to build Kaiba Land.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.33,0:19:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We will, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.95,0:19:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as soon as I teach Pegasus a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.17,0:19:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
